<title>UK: CIC sets 1.0 bln Ffr perpetual fixed/FRN.</title>
<headline>CIC sets 1.0 bln Ffr perpetual fixed/FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was launched as a 1.0 billion French franc deal and was increased to 1.25 billion French francs within a few minutes, by joint lead managers CIC and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPAGNIE FINANCIERE DE CIC ET DE L'UNION EUROPEENNE</p>
<p> AMT   1.25 BLN FRF   COUPON    *6.60	MATURITY  **PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE SUB DEBENTURE   ISS PRICE  100.886   PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.786    SPREAD	+100 BP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.70	SELL CONC  1.00	LISTING     PARIS</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.5 PCT APR 2007 OAT / 8.5 PCT OCT 08 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEARS ONE TO TEN AND THEN 3M-PIBOR PLUS 2.25 PCT</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE FROM 11.JUN.07.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
